# TFPT — project map & contribution workflow

> Always-on invariants + skill routing: rule **`tfpt-core`**.  
> New vN module: skill **`promote-to-verification`** + **`tfpt-deep-sync`**.  
> Experiments only: skill **`tfpt-experiment`**.

TFPT is a discrete "compiler": two axioms — seam constant `c3 = 1/(8π)` (P1) and
carrier rank `g_car = 5` (P2) — build `D5 ⊕ A3 + μ4 ⇒ E8` and read off the SM,
constants and scale grammar. Every load-bearing claim must be machine-checked.

## Where things live

- **Active papers** — stable root `.tex` entry points assemble modules under
  `documents/`; locate the owner in `docs/registry/INDEX.md`. `build.sh notes`
  compiles the active set. See `docs/LATEX_MAINTENANCE.md` for targeted builds.
- **Central content registry** — `verification/make_content_registry.py` generates
  `docs/registry/` from authored sources, the ledger and actual proof references.
  Explicit citations and inferred navigation links have different relation types.
- **Shared TeX** — `tex-artefacts/` only (never fork): `tfpt_style.tex`, `tfpt_docset.tex`,
  `tfpt_status.tex`, **`verification.tex` (GENERATED)** from `script_registry.csv`.
- **Changelog** — modular source owned by the `changelog.tex` entry point; drives the generated website history.
- **Verification** — `verification/vN_*.py`, `run_all.py`, `tfpt_constants.py`,
  **`status_ledger.csv` (source of truth)**, `wolfram/`, sync scripts, `audit_sync.py`.
- **Figures** — `figures/*.pdf` via `make_figures.py`.
- **Lean** — `experiments/lean4-carrier-rigidity/` shipped as `lean4-carrier-rigidity/`.
- **Experiments** — `experiments/` (search/scorecard; skill `tfpt-experiment`).
- **Website** — `website/` mirror; see **`website-sync`** rule.
- **Legacy** — `_archive/` read-only unless asked.
- **Venv** — `experiments/tfpt-discovery/.venv`.

## Status markers

Display: `\mE/\mC/\mO/\mX` → `[E]/[C]/[O]/[X]`. Ledger: fine types (Axiom/Formal/Lattice/Numerical/Identity/Physical). Status moves → sync intro status card + `tfpt_4_frontier` + website status components.

## NEW finding workflow

Full step-by-step: skill **`promote-to-verification`**. Summary:

> **⚠️ ALWAYS SUMMARISE CONCRETE RESULTS FIRST — THEN UPDATE.**

1. Explore → write `verification/vN_<name>.py` (`tfpt_constants`, `check()/summary()/reset()`)
2. Register: `run_all.py`, `script_registry.csv`, run standalone + `run_all.py`
3. **`bash build.sh gen`** → launch **`tfpt-deep-sync`** subagents → merge checklist → edit papers (`\veri{}` in **body**, not index alone)
4. Wolfram if exact (`tfpt_readouts.wl` + README count + `GATE.WOLFRAM.01`)
5. Ledger row + **`changelog.tex`** entry (mention vN id)
6. `bash build.sh release` → **`AUDIT OK`**; browser-check website
7. `make_manifest.py` last

Deep-sync completeness (every surface agrees): skill **`tfpt-deep-sync`**.

## Zenodo

- Description: `zenodo_description.html`; version from `build.sh` / `\TFPTversion` in `tex-artefacts/version.tex`
- Edit HTML when: curated release bump, repro counts, status/open-gates/falsifiability prose, metadata URL change
- Commands: `bash build.sh zenodo` / `zenodo-publish`

## Maintenance

```bash
. experiments/tfpt-discovery/.venv/bin/activate
cd verification && python run_all.py                    # ALL CHECKS PASSED
wolframscript -file wolfram/tfpt_readouts.wl            # ALL WOLFRAM CHECKS PASSED
bash build.sh audit                                     # AUDIT OK
bash build.sh release                                   # full pre-commit
python make_manifest.py                                 # last
```

## Invariants (do not break)

- Suite stays green; add vN checks, never delete
- Every `run_all.py` script: `\veri{}` in paper body + registry row
- Generated files never hand-edited (see `tfpt-core`)
- Wolfram count = README count = ledger `GATE.WOLFRAM.01`
- `\phiz` → write `(\phiz)^n`; Planck mass: `\Mbar` vs `\Mpl` in `tfpt_4_frontier`
- No old-version framing ("TFPT 4.5", "Paper 3 shows…")
- TeX visual sanity: no overfull `\vbox`; tables >~35 rows → `xltabular`
- `papers.ts` mirrors section content, not just titles
